              <span>See everything you'll walk away with</span>
              <span class="journey__kit-chev" aria-hidden="true">+</span>
            </summary>
            <div class="journey__kit-body">
              <button class="jflip" type="button" data-jflip>
                <span class="jflip__inner">
                  <span class="jflip__face jflip__front"><h4>Copy that sells</h4><span class="jwhat">Descriptions, listings, sales &amp; landing pages, emails.</span><span class="jcue">Flip for the payoff &rarr;</span></span>
                  <span class="jflip__face jflip__back"><span class="jplabel">Profit</span><p>Turns browsers into buyers on the page where they decide.</p></span>
                </span>
              </button>
              <button class="jflip" type="button" data-jflip>
                <span class="jflip__inner">
                  <span class="jflip__face jflip__front"><h4>Social &amp; discovery</h4><span class="jwhat">Posts, hooks, captions, SEO, tags, launch carousels.</span><span class="jcue">Flip for the payoff &rarr;</span></span>
                  <span class="jflip__face jflip__back"><span class="jplabel">Profit</span><p>Free reach that sends people to your product.</p></span>
                </span>
              </button>
              <button class="jflip" type="button" data-jflip>
                <span class="jflip__inner">
                  <span class="jflip__face jflip__front"><h4>Visuals &amp; images</h4><span class="jwhat">Mockups, ad graphics, hero banners, lifestyle images.</span><span class="jcue">Flip for the payoff &rarr;</span></span>
                  <span class="jflip__face jflip__back"><span class="jplabel">Profit</span><p>Pro visuals make a product look worth buying.</p></span>
                </span>
              </button>
              <button class="jflip" type="button" data-jflip>
                <span class="jflip__inner">
                  <span class="jflip__face jflip__front"><h4>Full ad package</h4><span class="jwhat">Video script, voiceover, music, and photo animation.</span><span class="jcue">Flip for the payoff &rarr;</span></span>
                  <span class="jflip__face jflip__back"><span class="jplabel">Profit</span><p>A finished ad feels like a real brand — and sells like one.</p></span>
                </span>
              </button>
              <button class="jflip" type="button" data-jflip>
                <span class="jflip__inner">
                  <span class="jflip__face jflip__front"><h4>Custom GPT</h4><span class="jwhat">A complete GPT configuration for your product.</span><span class="jcue">Flip for the payoff &rarr;</span></span>
                  <span class="jflip__face jflip__back"><span class="jplabel">Profit</span><p>A 24/7 assistant that helps you keep selling.</p></span>
                </span>
              </button>
              <button class="jflip" type="button" data-jflip>
                <span class="jflip__inner">
                  <span class="jflip__face jflip__front"><h4>Everything, saved</h4><span class="jwhat">Reusable brand profiles and a one-file download.</span><span class="jcue">Flip for the payoff &rarr;</span></span>
                  <span class="jflip__face jflip__back"><span class="jplabel">Profit</span><p>Hand it to a VA, and launch your next product in minutes.</p></span>
                </span>
              </button>
